      "math_academy_id": "e-3296",
      "problem": "Given that ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/4ffca40aa3af37518948cc1fc95601eee29818bf73839e2c3a68089b13a47761.svg) is obtuse, calculate its measure. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/4c03261cd772021bfa3ddf84f5499322d554b636e755b67c879617b17050f92b.png)",
      "worked_solution": "The law of sines states that\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/23dfadbb4389a5cd21b09c6e93633cdf7ca3195c3c00b2dbef680f69f4b4319b.svg)\n\nIn this case, we have\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/a772d5a9fbe37dfff5eb4a746df1651303a2f8b863e03e3ac3b587c0fb39f3f3.svg)\nand therefore\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/eace76ce0a6743dd93781840cf5bc48b9d8c2e2599f746d6aa8362d3bdacca53.svg)\nrounded to five decimal places. This gives\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/0ef2e86f19b5c0389de30ee00eac96f453a4ce89a23599634ff3612bb7d98e32.svg)\nrounded to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/f5f3224583db57b9cfe323c8489ef5e5271000002b5ea253eb98fd067a858b2d.svg) decimal places.\n\nBut this is less than ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/03a137fc65ebb85d18b0e91e258c5f72b7f0d9164afdbb944446de3124eadd68.svg) To get the true value of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/c2c85081d1f89d74b8ebb2761496d211d7052193809b7864e7983437f5d0b80f.svg) we subtract our answer from ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/60d3b7ef2bffb0178e920cd590ca89ed6745c47beb6cd39ab198423497a67add.svg)\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14266767/assets/c50708540eb93b95b4b31fd65c6cdab81adcf8ab01e69732824977e58ecab712.svg)",
